cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CACE-Bench: A Synthetic Agentic Evaluation Benchmark for LLM Credit-Pipeline Agents"
message: "If you use CACE-Bench, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Akhtyamov"
    given-names: "Ravil"
    affiliation: "Digital Economy Lab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rav11l/cace-bench"
url: "https://digitaleconomylab.org"
abstract: >-
  Compliance-Aware Credit-agent Evaluation (CACE-Bench): a fully synthetic,
  reproducible benchmark and generator for evaluating and auto-evolving
  LLM-agent credit pipelines under auditability constraints. Measures
  hallucination rate, recovery rate, compliance false-positive rate and
  step-level correctness on ~23k labelled multi-agent traces.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "‹FILL: YYYY-MM-DD of the v0.1.0 release›"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - agentic evaluation
  - benchmark
  - credit pipeline
  - compliance
  - auditability
  - explainable AI
